{"id":"068ed3bb67d8295c","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-trace-order-bound.md","title":"可计算可迹性的任意正阶函数界","display":"thm-trace-order-bound — 可计算可迹性的任意正阶函数界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-trace-order-bound","aliases":["43-thm-trace-order-bound"],"display":"thm-trace-order-bound — 可计算可迹性的任意正阶函数界","depends_on":["[[43-df-computably-traceable]]","[[43-df-computable-trace]]","[[43-df-order-function]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Lemma 16.1.6; printed p.482 / PDF p.502","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-trace-order-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-trace-order-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-trace-order-bound — 可计算可迹性的任意正阶函数界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" href=\"?note=abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" title=\"43-df-computably-traceable\">43-df-computably-traceable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"782b07fc06268214\" href=\"?note=782b07fc06268214\" title=\"43-df-computable-trace\">43-df-computable-trace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9919dea7144eefd8\" href=\"?note=9919dea7144eefd8\" title=\"43-df-order-function\">43-df-order-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Lemma 16.1.6; printed p.482 / PDF p.502"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableTrace}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableTrace}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Order}\">\\(\\operatorname{Order}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computable}^A\">\\(\\operatorname{Computable}^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" href=\"?note=abd2ac3cf0e63c86\" title=\"43-df-computably-traceable\">43-df-computably-traceable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"782b07fc06268214\" href=\"?note=782b07fc06268214\" title=\"43-df-computable-trace\">43-df-computable-trace</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9919dea7144eefd8\" href=\"?note=9919dea7144eefd8\" title=\"43-df-order-function\">43-df-order-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}(A)\\iff\\forall h\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Order}(h)\\Rightarrow\\forall f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left[\\operatorname{Computable}^A(f)\\Rightarrow\\exists g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\mathrm{ComputableTrace}(g,f,h)\\right]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}(A)\\iff\\forall h\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Order}(h)\\Rightarrow\\forall f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left[\\operatorname{Computable}^A(f)\\Rightarrow\\exists g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\mathrm{ComputableTrace}(g,f,h)\\right]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>通过一次追踪越来越长的f初段再投影，可把原统一界减慢到任意给定正阶函数。h处处为正是必要的，否则零大小迹不能覆盖任何全函数值；未照抄原稿“slower”而遗漏这一边界。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Lemma 16.1.6; printed p.482 / PDF p.502。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computably-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"abd2ac3cf0e63c86","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computably-traceable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-trace","status":"resolved","id":"782b07fc06268214","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-trace]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-order-function","status":"resolved","id":"9919dea7144eefd8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-order-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excer